1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,473
The Tidepath portal is a public website with no login.

2
00:00:02,553 --> 00:00:06,640
Maria, a volunteer mentor, opens the check-in form in Spanish.

3
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:11,906
She logs 1 hour with Kevin and marks an urgent need: a laptop.

4
00:00:11,986 --> 00:00:14,939
She taps Send. No login, no app to install.

5
00:00:15,019 --> 00:00:23,539
A school counselor requests a safety workshop in Spanish.

6
00:00:23,619 --> 00:00:26,373
She sends it. She does not need an account.

7
00:00:26,453 --> 00:00:34,166
Later, the school approves slides version 2 on the portal.

